   "en": "'Almost done' for the third month isn't a delay. It's a process problem. 🧭\n\n1️⃣ You've paid but haven't seen working software\n✅ Fix: we build in small increments on a staging URL you can click through\n\n2️⃣ The scope keeps changing, and so does the price\n✅ Fix: a written scope before any work: what's in, what's out, milestones and estimate\n\n3️⃣ The project launched and you don't have the code\n✅ Fix: source in a repo you can access throughout, a rollback path and a handover walkthrough\n\nMarigold Bakery is a concept demo.\nSend this to a business owner who needs it.\nWant a project that runs like this? Comment PROCESS 👇\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated."
